    answerHtml: "<strong>Short answer:</strong> AI lease abstraction works best when you give the AI a lease abstract template you already trust and ask it to fill each field from the lease, citing the section it came from. Load the lease, amendments and exhibits, ask explicitly for every exhibit you need, and have a person check rent, critical dates, options and recoveries before anyone relies on the abstract.",
